s://api.github.com/users/usualoma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T13:10:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T13:10:13Z","body":"Hi @BlankParticle,\r\nThanks for the comment!\r\n\r\nI’d avoid `req.constructor.name` because constructor names can change during minification, so this check may become unstable in bundled/minified output.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/4866058453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/4866131949","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5071#issuecomment-4866131949","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/5071","id":4866131949,"node_id":"IC_kwDOGiE5WM8AAAABIgtH7Q","user":{"login":"BlankParticle","id":130567419,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8hM-w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130567419?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle","html_url":"https://github.com/BlankParticle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T13:16:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T13:18:10Z","body":"> Hi @BlankParticle, Thanks for the comment!\r\n> \r\n> I’d avoid `req.constructor.name` because constructor names can change during minification, so this check may become unstable in bundled/minified output.\r\n\r\nmakes sense, right now its stable but will cause issues in minification, \r\nbut `'headers' in request` looks very random, and there is no explanation attached either\r\nI think its better to target known properties on `HonoRequest` instead of the other way\r\na better check would probably be `\"addValidatedData\" in request` (or any other specific propertly on HonoRequest) to validate the object is a hono request, with some comment added on top to explain the reasoning","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/4866131949/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/4866234705","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5071#issuecomment-4866234705","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/5071","id":4866234705,"node_id":"IC_kwDOGiE5WM8AAAABIgzZUQ","user":{"login":"usualoma","id":30598,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30598?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma","html_url":"https://github.com/usualoma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/usualoma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T13:26:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T13:26:29Z","body":"Hi @BlankParticle,\r\nThanks for the comment.\r\n\r\nI understand what you're saying. However, `global.Request` could be overridden or extended. So, there's a slight chance (though I don't think that's actually the case) that `global.Request` might have an `addValidatedData` property.\r\n\r\nI think it would be more reliable to check for “properties that `HonoRequest` doesn't have” instead.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/4866234705/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/4866283482","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5071#issuecomment-4866283482","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/5071","id":4866283482,"node_id":"IC_kwDOGiE5WM8AAAABIg2X2g","user":{"login":"BlankParticle","id":130567419,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8hM-w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130567419?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle","html_url":"https://github.com/BlankParticle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlankParticle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":